            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>console.log(\"Hi there!\");</code> do bloku kodu pętli while, umieszczając go między <code>{</code> a <code>}</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi there!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>while (true) {</code>, następnie <code>console.log(\"Hi there!\");</code> i na końcu <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Umieść <code>console.log(\"Hi there!\");</code> wewnątrz pętli while, która będzie stale wyświetlać <code>Hi there!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi there!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.error\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi there!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>while</code>, następnie <code>true</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>console.log</code> i na końcu <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
